meta {
  name: Get Delegation Token (space.getDelegationToken)
  type: http
  seq: 140
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/xrpc/com.atproto.space.getDelegationToken?space={{space}}
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessJwt}}
}

vars:pre-request {
  baseUrl: http://localhost:8080
  space: at://did:plc:exampleauthority/space/org.example.bucket/self
}

docs {
  Atproto Spaces (proposal 0016). Mints a single-use, 60 s delegation token for `space`
  (`at://{authority}/space/{spaceType}/{skey}`), signed by the account's `#atproto` repo key
  (`typ atproto-space-delegation+jwt`, `kid #atproto`, `sub` = space, `aud` =
  `{authority}#atproto_pds`). Requires an OAuth (or full-access) session whose grant covers
  `read` on the space — a `read_self`-only grant gets 403 InsufficientScope, and an
  app-password session gets 401 InvalidToken, as on every account-session space method.
  The app passes it in the body of the authority's `authorizeSpaceSync` for a space credential.
}
